            "review_title": "Review at Coco Ichibanya Vietnam - Lý Tự Trọng",
            "review_text": "eileent3821\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia2474 contributions\n0\nDELICIOUS JAPANESE CURRY\nApr 2024 • Friends\nA casual Japanese curry style restaurant where you can pick your own spice level, curry amount and rice amount. There are also a wide selection of toppings and add ons. The staff can't really communicate in English except taking orders. Super fast super cheap and very tasty. I'll be back. The menu selection is easy and you can add lots of options to create variety.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 26, 2024",
